<title>USA: Harold's Stores stake held by Laifer group.</title>
<headline>Harold's Stores stake held by Laifer group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Laifer Capital Management said Thursday it holds 472,208 common shares or an 8.7 percent stake in Harold's Stores Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it most recently acquired shares of the Norman, Okla-retailer between February 21 and April 8 at $12.19 to $13.38 each.</p>
<p>The group said it holds a stake in Harold's for investment.</p>
